        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"MigrantP\"]\n\nSuppose you have 4 screws in your hand. You buy a card that costs 4 screws. Clearly you cannot buy another card. But can you still build a card from your hand? The rule book does not say otherwise, so we&#39;ve been playing that you can.\n\n[/quote]\n\nWhy wouldn&#39;t you be able to?\n",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": true,
        "admin": false,
        "staff": true,
        "user_id": 18,
        "hidden": false,
        "trust_level": 4,
